      "writtenOn": "2025-03-18T21:44:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done\n\nI\u0027ve explained the vendor constraint in libavf. For AIDL interfaces, I\u0027ve added docs to the instance ID fields that suggest looking at libavf for details. The Java APIs seem to treat instance IDs as an implementation detail, so I haven\u0027t updated their docs.",
