        "id": 1944400
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-11T22:41:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The spot I\u0027m checking it from in this CL (`create_vm_internal`) will should catch all VMs.\n\nWhen I say it is tricky, I mean that we can\u0027t differentiate randomly assigned IDs from staticly chosen IDs. They all provide the ID the same way. We\u0027d need to do something like keep a DB of the randomly assigned IDs and then check if the ID is in it if we want to treat them differently policy wise.",
      "parentUuid": "e80a29ad_b22acb5f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 69
      },
