    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "28fe9f2c_18c670af",
        "filename": "android/virtmgr/src/aidl.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 616,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-25T12:46:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m slightly concerned about an already created VM (say system owned Tartarus VM in Android 15), which got allocated instance-id with first bytes 0xFFFFFFFF (and the probability of the is 1/2^32).\n\nThat will continue to run in Android 16 with the old allocated instance-id. So that VM technically will be using the \"wrongly\" allocated instance-id but that will not pose any problem till some vendor-owned app wants to use that exact same instance-id as the static id. I think we can ignore this particular problem as the probability of that happening is (1/2^60)",
      "parentUuid": "3fdf12f4_557544cb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 616,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 616,
        "endChar": 87
      },
      "revId": "f20605ab620509b25545d2f1640e9a041c421f36",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "68eee790_f03aa8f4",
        "filename": "android/virtmgr/src/aidl.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 616,
      "author": {
        "id": 1944400
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-26T00:02:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree.\n\nnit: it is `1/2^60` per \"roll\" of the dice and there there are billions of android devices (I know we don\u0027t have these VMs on all of them yet...) so there are a lot of rolls. It is still extremely unlikely even then if I did the calculation right.\n\n```\n$ python3\n\u003e\u003e\u003e (1 - (1 / decimal.Decimal(2)**60))**7_000_000_000_000\nDecimal(\u00270.9999939284862657141184497706\u0027)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "28fe9f2c_18c670af",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 616,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 616,
        "endChar": 87
      },
      "revId": "f20605ab620509b25545d2f1640e9a041c421f36",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "607ea432_197804dc",
        "filename": "android/virtmgr/src/aidl.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 617,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-26T11:45:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about?\n```\nlet vendor_like \u003d matches!(calling_partition, CallingPartition::Vendor | CallingPartition::Odm);\n\n(vendor_like \u0026\u0026 !instance_id.starts_with(INSTANCE_ID_VENDOR_PREFIX)) ||\n(!vendor_like \u0026\u0026 instance_id.starts_with(INSTANCE_ID_VENDOR_PREFIX))\n{\n   // err\n}\n```\n\nThis will ensure no other partiiton can claim from vendor reserved range either",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 616,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 617,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "f20605ab620509b25545d2f1640e9a041c421f36",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a52f3ef8_6f811bc8",
        "filename": "android/virtmgr/src/aidl.rs",
