      "writtenOn": "2025-03-11T22:41:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about the old randomly assigned IDs? There\u0027d be a 1 in 2^32 chance of a collision with the vendor prefix, which is reasonably likely if you\u0027ve got 100s of millions of them.",
      "parentUuid": "607ea432_197804dc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 616,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 617,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "f20605ab620509b25545d2f1640e9a041c421f36",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "99d8db38_41e408af",
        "filename": "android/virtmgr/src/aidl.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 617,
      "author": {
        "id": 1944400
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-18T21:44:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, I don\u0027t think this is viable right now unforuantely. Hopefully we can think harder about it next release. Marking this resolved.",
      "parentUuid": "a52f3ef8_6f811bc8",
      "range": {
